[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9363.27, "timestamp": "02:36:03", "text": "我不知道。不用担心。这是我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9366.95, "timestamp": "02:36:06", "text": "某种程度上来说，这是我们第一次合作。呃，我们有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9369.51, "timestamp": "02:36:09", "text": "我们在小组中相遇"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9373.349, "timestamp": "02:36:13", "text": "之前有过合作吧？是的。是的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9375.99, "timestamp": "02:36:15", "text": "这是我们第一次合作拍摄我自己。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9379.429, "timestamp": "02:36:19", "text": "有点紧张。就像那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9383.67, "timestamp": "02:36:23", "text": "参与一次合作让我有点紧张。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9397.67, "timestamp": "02:36:37", "text": "是的，这是我们的第一次，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9400.469, "timestamp": "02:36:40", "text": "很高兴能有机会和你交谈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9402.71, "timestamp": "02:36:42", "text": "跟你聊聊天什么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9406.15, "timestamp": "02:36:46", "text": "像这样合作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9409.429, "timestamp": "02:36:49", "text": "我也挺高兴的，因为你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9415.429, "timestamp": "02:36:55", "text": "一切都好吗？怎样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9417.349, "timestamp": "02:36:57", "text": "你？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9419.349, "timestamp": "02:36:59", "text": "社区里的情况一直都很好。"}]